'''Total War: Winter Special''' (大乱闘 冬イベスペシャル ''Dai Rantō Fuyu Ibesupesharu'', '''Great Free-for-All Winter Eve Special''') is the Winter [[Total Wars|Total War]]. It is unlocked after clearing [[Jingle Cat Bell (Monthly Event)|Jingle Cat Bell]], [[Happy New Year? (Monthly Event)|Happy New Year?]] and [[Ritual Happiness (Monthly Event)|Ritual Happiness]],  and contains enemies from all three events. It was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

